# Smoke test for settings (system config UI).
# Only the initial frame is captured; the version page contains an
# auto-scrolling LVGL label whose marquee offset depends on wall-clock
# tick timing, which makes any later screenshot non-deterministic.
# RETURN exits the app and asserts we didn't crash on the way out.

app settings

wait_ms 200
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action GO_FORWORD
wait_ms 700
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
